flowchart TD
    A[LSP Property Rules] --> B[Class Invariants]
    A --> C[History Constraint]
    A --> D[final Notes]

    B --> B1[BankAccount: balance non-negative]
    B --> B2[CheatAccount: allows negative balance]
    B2 --> B3[Invariant broken]
    B3 --> B4[LSP Broken]

    C --> C1[Parent allows valid withdraw]
    C --> C2[FixedDepositAccount forbids withdraw]
    C2 --> C3[Behavior history changed]
    C3 --> C4[LSP Broken]

    D --> D1[final class: no inheritance]
    D --> D2[final method: no override]
    D2 --> D3[Language-level restriction note]

    B4:::bad
    C4:::bad
    D3:::neutral

    classDef bad fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:1px,color:#b71c1c;
    classDef neutral fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:1px,color:#0d47a1;
